---LINES

mainv   = h   " main view                         "
mainvk  = c   "main view keys:"

cmded   = h   " command editor                  "
cmdedk  = c   "command editor keys:"

exit    = h   " exit trap                "
exitk   = c   "keys of trap on exit:"

hist    = h   " history view             "
histk   = c   "history view keys:"

runcmd  = hm "run a command"

---# m       = gm  - - - - " *)"
m       = g  - - - - " *)"
---# a       = cx "<1>"
---# b       = cx "<2>"
---# c       = cx "<3>"
a       = cx "1:"
b       = cx "2:"
c       = cx "3:"

X	= hx "[=]"
cmd     = hx "[a-z./]"
CMD     = hx "[A-Z0-9]"

---SCREEN
=vash workflow -- context switching                                      
!                                       please, see 'man vash' for more details
!.mainvk...............................                                                                               
! .'lowercase,dot,slash                                 .:HE... help           
!     type a command from scratch  .a                   .:EX... exit,return     
! .'uppercase,digit                                     .:CA    cancel                
!     edit a command from template .b     .mainv...............................       
!     execute predefined command   .c      ^ .:CA    ^         .cmd... .CMD.... 
! .:CA switch editor <--> main view        :   :     :              :    :   :  
!                                          :   :  .X.:             .a    :   : 
!.cmdedk...............................    :   : .hist............  :   .b   : 
! .:HE... switch to history view           :   :    ^       .:NL... :    :  .c 
! .:NL... run a command                    :   :    :          :    :    :   :
!                                          : .:CA .:HE...      :    :    :   : 
!.histk................................    : .cmded......................... :  
! .:NL... take a command to editor         :        ^              .:NL...   :  
! .:CA    back to editor untouched         :       .a                :       :    
!                                         .:CA      :                :       :
!.exitk................................   .:SP... .cmd...      .runcmd.........
! .:SP...| .:CA return to main view       .exit..........  <--                    
! .'lovercase  return to editor             


---END                                                                         
+  .:NL...  - defencive trap for mistakes   
                                      
